# Build-time flags (docs/security/FINDINGS.md SEC-F04). Leave unset for the safe default:
#   dev server (npm run dev, Cypress) → fake backend + demo-user picker ON
#   production build (npm run build)  → both OFF (real API via the /api proxy)
# true forces a feature on, false forces it off.
# VITE_MOCK_BACKEND=
# VITE_DEMO_LOGIN=
